   "evidence": "`rg 'sum_norm_sq|row_norm|norm_sq_row' upstream/mathlib/Mathlib` returns only `inner_eq_sum_norm_sq_div_four`, so no upstream lemma covers this; `EpsilonEridani/Mathematics/DataStructures/Matrix/UnitaryTrace.lean:32` shows the repo's canonical pattern of public `Matrix`-namespace matrix lemmas in their own module.",
